# Opening Edge / ply-chess
# Copy to .env.local. Never commit real values.

# --- Auth (public only — safe in the browser) ---
# Dedicated Opening Edge Supabase project. See LAUNCH.md.
# Google client secret stays in the Supabase dashboard. Phone OTP is deferred.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- TTS (unused — Learn is silent; keys do nothing in the UI) ---
# Voice playback, mute toggles, speaker chips, and focus music were removed.
# Do not add NEXT_PUBLIC_ TTS keys.

# --- Optional Coach Brain v2 (off by default) ---
# Teaching-intent layer on top of authored hooks. Legacy coach stays
# default-safe unless this is 1/true/on, or the player enables it in Settings.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_COACH_BRAIN_V2=
